  "about_item": [
    "Humane Solution for Safer Outings: This humane dog muzzle gently helps reduce biting, chewing, scavenging, and barking—without making your dog feel restrained. Great for vet visits, grooming, travel, or meeting new people",
    "All-Day Comfort with Soft Mesh: Our soft dog muzzle is crafted with lightweight, breathable mesh to keep your dog cool and relaxed. Smooth edges prevent rubbing or pressure, making it ideal for long-term wear in any season",
    "Freedom to Drink, Breathe & Be Rewarded:Unlike bulky gear, this mesh dog muzzle lets your dog drink water, pant, and enjoy treats during training. It's a perfect balance of safety and comfort that your dog won't mind wearing",
    "Fits Small, Medium & Large Breeds: Whether you're shopping for a muzzle for small and medium-sized dogs or a muzzle for large dogs, our adjustable straps offer a custom fit and stay securely in place, even on active pups",
    "Durable, But Supervision is Recommended: Made with reinforced nylon, this mesh muzzle for dogs is built for daily use—but dogs with strong chewing habits may still damage it. We recommend supervising during early use to prevent tearing"
  ],
