        "position": 7,
        "title": "Perfect",
        "text": "Love this muzzle. Admittedly my boy is not quite as enthusiastic about it, but he’s spoiled. Much better than other muzzles used. There is cushioning around the seams over the nose and around the jaw which is great. The mesh, as you can see in second photo, wraps completely under the chin which keeps his mouth dry and ventilated. So no drool puddling or condensation build up. He can drink and breath easily. The added forehead strap is great because he can not swipe the basket down off his nose as he has done before with others and this stays nice and secure. (Probably another reason for my baby’s lack of excitement for this little accessory.) My boy has skin conditions pop up and this keeps him from licking and worsening the rashes.",
